#: ../../api/methods/delete_ephemeral_message.rst:3
msgid "deleteEphemeralMessage"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.methods.delete_ephemeral_message.DeleteEphemeralMessage:1 of
msgid ""
"Use this method to delete an ephemeral message. Note that it is not "
"guaranteed that the user will receive the message deletion event, "
"especially if they are offline. Returns :code:`True` on success."
msgstr ""
"Удаляет эфемерное сообщение. Получение пользователем события об удалении "
"не гарантируется, особенно если он не в сети. При успехе возвращает "
":code:`True`."

#: litegram.methods.delete_ephemeral_message.DeleteEphemeralMessage:3 of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#deleteephemeralmessage"
msgstr "Источник: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#deleteephemeralmessage"

#: litegram.methods.delete_ephemeral_message.DeleteEphemeralMessage.chat_id:1
#: of
msgid ""
"Unique identifier for the target chat or username of the target "
"supergroup in the format :code:`@username`"
msgstr ""
"Уникальный идентификатор целевого чата или имя целевой супергруппы в "
"формате :code:`@username`"

#: litegram.methods.delete_ephemeral_message.DeleteEphemeralMessage.receiver_user_id:1
#: of
msgid "Identifier of the user who received the message"
msgstr "Идентификатор пользователя, получившего сообщение"

#: litegram.methods.delete_ephemeral_message.DeleteEphemeralMessage.ephemeral_message_id:1
#: of
msgid "Identifier of the ephemeral message to delete"
msgstr "Идентификатор эфемерного сообщения, которое нужно удалить"

